# Copy to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.

# --- Ingest (Node worker) ---
# Fine-grained PAT, read-only public repos. Without it GitHub allows 60 requests/hour.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Non-secret settings (GITHUB_SYNC_URL, MAX_PAGES, DB_PATH) have defaults in src/config.ts.
# Set them here only to override a default locally.

# --- LLM (rag API) ---
# Key from a Google Cloud project with NO billing account (free tier: over-limit calls return 429, never a bill).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
